### Student API samples
@host = https://localhost:5001
@inst = demo-inst

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/stu/students?search=Alice&page=1&pageSize=20
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/stu/students
Content-Type: application/json
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "gender": "Female",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "instId": "{{inst}}",
  "courseId": "C1",
  "courseName": "Class I",
  "secName": "A"
}

### Get by id
GET {{host}}/api/stu/students/{{studentId}}

### Sectionwise report
GET {{host}}/api/stu/report/sectionwise?instId={{inst}}
